        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chantal Claret, Max Green, Pedro Yanowitz\n- Bands: Morningwood, Escape the Fate, The Natural Born Killers\n- Albums: Diamonds & Studs\n\nFacts:\n- Morningwood was founded in 2001.\n- Morningwood primarily consisted of Pedro Yanowitz and Chantal Claret.\n- Chantal Claret Euringer was born on February 21, 1982.\n- Chantal Claret Euringer is known professionally as Chantal Claret.\n- Chantal Claret is an American singer-songwriter.\n- Maxwell Scott Green was born on December 15, 1984.\n- Maxwell Scott Green is better known as Max Green.\n- Max Green is an American musician.\n- Max Green was one of the founders of Escape the Fate.\n- Max Green was the former bassist and backing vocalist of Escape the Fate.\n- Max Green was the former rhythm guitarist and vocalist for The Natural Born Killers.\n- Diamonds & Studs is the second album by Morningwood.",
